.\" RamkolFX - GPL-3.0-only (or a separate commercial license); see LICENSE.
.TH RAMKOLFX\-GUI 1 "" "RamkolFX @RAMKOLFX_VERSION_FULL@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ramkolfx\-gui \- control app for the RamkolFX spatial audio daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ramkolfx\-gui
.RB [ \-\-minimized ]
.br
.B ramkolfx\-gui
.RB \-V | \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ramkolfx\-gui
controls a running
.BR ramkolfxd (1):
spatial mode and HRTF, speaker positions, the graphic EQ and its presets,
Auto\-detect and the bass enhancer.
It talks to the daemon only over its control socket and needs no PipeWire
access of its own.
.PP
Only one instance runs per user; starting it again brings the running
window forward.
It can sit in the system tray (StatusNotifierItem) and start on login.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-minimized
Start in the background: hidden in the tray if a tray option is enabled
and a tray is available, otherwise minimized.
The login autostart entry uses this.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_GUI_SCALE
UI scale factor, from 0.5 to 4.0, overriding the display DPI guess.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ramkolfx/gui_prefs.conf
GUI preferences.
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME
defaults to
.IR ~/.config .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ramkolfxd (1)
.PP
.UR https://github.com/Coldsteel48/RamkolFX
.UE
